OL,18,     FMonday to Thursday, Bristol
OL,19,     Ffounded group Tara Clerkin Trio.
OL,20,     FThey are collectively sharing four
OL,21,     Fof their best-loved jazz records,
OL,22,     Ffor 4/4.
